    {
      "name": "Reports",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "script",
          "name": "Summary",
          "source": "MonthStart = DATE(2026, 10, 1)\nMonthEnd = EOMONTH(MonthStart, 0)\nIncome = SUMIFS(Transactions!Transactions[Amount], Transactions!Transactions[Type], \"Income\", Transactions!Transactions[Date], \">=\" & MonthStart, Transactions!Transactions[Date], \"<=\" & MonthEnd)\nExpenses = SUMIFS(Transactions!Transactions[Amount], Transactions!Transactions[Type], \"Expense\", Transactions!Transactions[Date], \">=\" & MonthStart, Transactions!Transactions[Date], \"<=\" & MonthEnd)\nNet = Income - Expenses\nASSERT(Income >= 0, \"Income cannot be negative\")\nASSERT(Expenses >= 0, \"Expenses cannot be negative\")\nASSERT(Net = Income - Expenses, \"Net must equal income minus expenses\")"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Monthly report",
          "source": "# October 2026\n\nIncome: **${{ Income }}**  \nExpenses: **${{ Expenses }}**  \nNet: **${{ Net }}**\n\n### Expenses by category\n\n{{ QUERY(Transactions, \"select Category, sum(Amount) where Type = 'Expense' and `Date` >= date '2026-10-01' and `Date` <= date '2026-10-31' group by Category order by sum(Amount) desc\") }}\n\n### Amounts by account\n\n{{ QUERY(Transactions, \"select Type, Account, sum(Amount) where `Date` >= date '2026-10-01' and `Date` <= date '2026-10-31' group by Type, Account order by Type, sum(Amount) desc\") }}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
